      "signpost": null,
      "definition": "the thing or things belonging to or connected with the speaker and at least one other person",
      "explanation": "**Ours** is the independent possessive, used without a following noun: *this house is ours*. The possessive determiner, used directly before a noun, is the different word **our** (*our house*), a separate entry.",
